5","pos":[270.000009733707,-879.9998853049095],"size":[620,680],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":261},{"localized_name":"标签","name":"tags","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"tags"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"歌词","name":"lyrics","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"lyrics"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":272},{"localized_name":"每分钟节拍数","name":"bpm","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bpm"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时长","name":"duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"duration"},"link":268},{"localized_name":"拍号","name":"timesignature","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"timesignature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"语言","name":"language","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"language"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"调式","name":"keyscale","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"keyscale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"生成音频代码","name":"generate_audio_codes","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"generate_audio_codes"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg_scale","name":"cfg_scale","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg_scale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"temperature","name":"temperature","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"temperature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_p","name":"top_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"最小 p","name":"min_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"min_p"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[254,255]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.11.1","Node name for S&R":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5","enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"secondTabWidth":65},"widgets_values":["chinese ancient style, lyrical guofeng pop, ethereal ambient, gentle orchestral arrangement, slow sentimental tempo\nCaption\nMelancholic and healing Chinese ancient style pop at 75 BPM in 4/4 time signature, featuring traditional guzheng and bamboo flute as core folk instruments, blended with soft ambient synth pads, warm string sections and subtle light percussion. The track builds gently from a quiet atmospheric intro with natural wind and wave ambient sounds, through soft narrative verses and emotional pre-chorus, evolving into lush, spacious chorus with layered vocal harmonies. Delicate bridge section adds dynamic tension with subtle orchestral swells, followed by a refined final chorus and a slow fading outro with ethereal residual vocals. Lead vocals are soft, clear and breathy with moderate reverb and subtle delay effect, delivering a serene, free and romantic mood of riverside scenery, martial arts tenderness and worldly fate, with a complete emotional arc from tranquil observation to affectionate relief and peaceful transcendence.","[Intro - Soft ambient wind & wave sounds, faint guzheng plucking, misty synth pad, no percussion]\n[Verse 1 - Gentle bamboo flute melody, sparse guzheng arpeggios, light shaker rhythm, quiet and empty reverberation]\n（soft narrative vocal, calm and ethereal delivery）\n青丝缓映柳絮飘\n繁华盛历俗世尘\n炊烟袅袅春色浓\n凡尘红透余生中\n夕阳西落云舒卷\n夜莺环绕海浪喧\n轻柔小雨听风鸣\n只间浮过随清缘\n[Pre-Chorus - String section slowly layers in, slightly enhanced percussion, rising melodic tension]\n（warm vocal tone, gentle emotional lifting）\n紫薇流露花酿酒\n笑与你随解愁\n万物皆为一生心\n余乐绕两黛笑容\n[Chorus - Full orchestral arrangement, layered backing vocals, steady soft drum groove, wide stereo reverb]\n（lucid and affectionate vocal, moderate volume elevation）\n风过柴门雨夜幽\n雨出水秀照心头\n风吹竹影月明灯\n心随动物世无穷\n过山川尽天地绕\n共吟一色雾青高\n清心如莲随风摇\n一岁明月相邀\n[Bridge - Orchestral swells, prominent guzheng lead, richer percussion texture, dynamic climax transition]\n（powerful yet tender vocal, full emotional expression）\n你来华夏山间水\n藏你细沙卷风雷\n一卷江湖情未尽\n挥毫天地乐逍遥\n轻绸执手绕相见\n天地同歌为君鸣\n花开花落岁月久\n余乐天华岁月悠\n[Verse 2 - Reduced instrumental layers, soft flute and piano focus, subdued rhythm]\n（soft nostalgic vocal, slightly restrained delivery）\n轻舟月影渡新愁\n江湖绕梦不破晓\n流水悠悠随时光\n一去三界梦一场\n[Chorus - Full instrumentation returns, doubled backing vocals, fuller mix texture]\n（stable and resonant vocal, sustained emotional warmth）\n风过柴门雨夜幽\n雨出水秀照心头\n风吹竹影月明灯\n心随动物世无穷\n过山川尽天地绕\n共吟一色雾青高\n清心如莲随风摇\n一岁明月相邀\n[Post-Chorus - Brightened synth pad, delicate glockenspiel notes, gentle rhythm weakens]\n（ethereal vocal with subtle delay, tranquil and transcendent tone）\n于水中遇见如来\n一曲清歌岁月长\n烟雨春风人未老\n留一方与你相邀\n余奔流水烟云散\n诗行一桌酒一盏\n花落世间尽清缘\n拾一岁风在人间\n[Outro - Gradually thinning instrumental layers, residual ambient wind sound]\n（whispery soft vocal, distant reverb effect）\n于水中遇见如来\n一曲清歌岁月长\n烟雨春风人未老\n留一方与你相邀\n[Outro - All instruments fade out gradually, only faint ambient wind sound remains till the end]",0,"fixed",75,200,"4","zh","E minor",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0]}],"links":[[119,47,0,3,2,"CONDITIONING"],[175,78,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[249,98,0,3,3,"LATENT"],[254,94,0,3,1,"CONDITIONING"],[255,94,0,47,0,"CONDITIONING"],[256,3,0,18,0,"LATENT"],[260,104,0,78,0,"MODEL"],[261,105,0,94,0,"CLIP"],[262,106,0,18,1,"VAE"],[266,111,2,112,0,"AUDIO"],[267,18,0,111,0,"AUDIO"],[268,114,0,94,5,"FLOAT"],[271,114,0,98,0,"FLOAT"],[272,117,0,94,3,"INT"],[273,117,0,3,4,"INT"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Model","bounding":[-210,-950,447.22598026477124,574.6629131689834],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"Prompt","bounding":[260,-950,638.8273441174483,900.1945499898729],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.248533369239024,"offset":[56.30220017343686,941.3186418695307]},"frontendVersion":"1.41.21","workflowRendererVersion":"LG","VHS_latentpreview":false,"VHS_latentpreviewrate":0,"VHS_MetadataImage":true,"VHS_KeepIntermediate":true},"version":0.4}